{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And one who steals a man.</b> Why is it said? Since it is said 'כי ימצא איש גונב נפש' — I have only witnesses to the theft; witnesses to the sale, from where? Scripture says: וגנב איש ומכרו — since his law is strangulation like the law of one who strikes his father, and furthermore both of them performed an act — they juxtaposed it to one who strikes his father." "<b>And he is found in his hand.</b> The negligence is by way of witnesses, or the clarification was revealed as if he were found in his hand." "<b>He shall surely be put to death.</b> For he brings him to death, since the buyer will do with him as he pleases. We have heard the punishment; the admonition, from where? Scripture says: לא תגנב."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:22.096984088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}